&lt;li&gt;下载地址：&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://gitee.com/mirrors/Umi-OCR&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://gitee.com/mirrors/Umi-OCR&lt;/a&gt; 。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
